<title>PERU: South Korea's Kim leaves Peru, ends 5-nation tour.</title>
<headline>South Korea's Kim leaves Peru, ends 5-nation tour.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1996-09-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korean President Kim Young-sam left Peru on Saturday to return home at the close of a five-nation Latin American tour.</p>
<p>Kim, who also visited Guatemala, Chile, Argentina and Brazil on his 12-day trip, spent three days in Peru.</p>
<p>During his visit to Peru, the South Korean president signed four accords aimed at strengthening trade links between the two Pacific Rim nations.</p>
</text>
